  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 - BREAKING CHANGES: API refactored for better UX. CheckAndSetValue renamed to Set. Parameter order changed to Set(value, ref backingField). Library targets .NET Standard 2.0 (works everywhere). Consumer apps targeting .NET 8+ can use C# 13 field keyword. See README for migration guide and compatibility details.",
